column104:
[off-topic]<p>Seriously? <i>x-small</i>?! No matter how pretty you think your site looks if people can't read the fucking text it doesn't matter. On top of that the contrast is terrible making it even worse.<p><pre><code>    font: x-small "Trebuchet MS", Trebuchet, Verdana, Sans-serif;
    font-size/* */:/**/small;
    font-size: /**/small;
</code></pre>
Sorry for the tangent I'm just tired of having to bump up the font size 2-5 times on every damn site I visit. And now I feel old. Shit.<p>(If you reply mentioning readability I will punch you :p Readability is not a cure-all and messes up some pages)
